	Nope.  None of the class-oriented artifacts are _necessary_ to
complete the game.  Some of them are very handy, but the Orb really isn't one
of them.  Don't concern yourself greatly with it.

>1. what is the limit to the carrying capacity of a bag of holding?  Is it
>   able to carry a filled sack as a regular item? (blessed/uncursed/cursed)

	Umm... Bags of holding don't work like that.  Anything placed inside a
bag of holding weighs a certain percentage of its real weight, based on the
bag's blessed/cursed state.  You could theoretically put the entire dungeon in
a bag of holding, though you wouldn't be able to carry it.  The exception to
that is that there are certain specific items which, when placed in a bag of
holding, will cause the bag to explode in just the manner you observed.  These
are a wand of cancellation, and any other bag.

